The bug was in advanceTurn at src/sim.ts:43 — the growth check used `foodSurplus >= 0`, so population grew even when production exactly equaled consumption (surplus of 0, i.e. "barely breaking even"). Changed it to `foodSurplus > 0`, so growth only happens on a real surplus.

